msgstr "由编译器生成（逐成员赋值），除非某个成员不能被赋值，*例如*流、`const` 成员或引用成员"

msgid "Summary"
msgstr "小结"

msgid "In this chapter, we have learned:"
msgstr "在本章中，我们学习了："

msgid "the copy constructor is called when a new object is created from an existing object, including when an object is passed or returned by value, or dynamically allocated with `new`,"
msgstr "从已有对象创建新对象时会调用拷贝构造函数，包括按值传递或按值返回对象，以及用 `new` 动态分配对象的情况，"

msgid "the default copy constructor and the default `operator=` copy each data member, which makes a shallow copy of pointers,"
msgstr "默认拷贝构造函数和默认 `operator=` 会复制每个数据成员，这对指针来说是浅拷贝，"

msgid "the default copy constructor is deleted if a data member, such as a stream, cannot be copied, the default `operator=` is deleted if a data member cannot be assigned, and we can delete either of them ourselves using `= delete`,"
msgstr "如果某个数据成员（例如流）不能被复制，默认拷贝构造函数会被删除；如果某个数据成员不能被赋值，默认 `operator=` 会被删除；我们也可以用 `= delete` 自己删除它们，"

msgid "how to implement a copy constructor that makes a deep copy,"
msgstr "如何实现进行深拷贝的拷贝构造函数，"

msgid "how to implement `operator=` that frees the old memory, handles self-assignment, and makes a deep copy, and"
msgstr "如何实现释放旧内存、处理自赋值并进行深拷贝的 `operator=`，以及"

msgid "the Rule of Three."
msgstr "三法则。"

msgid "In the next chapter, we will use these ideas to build linked lists, where objects point to other dynamically allocated objects."
msgstr "在下一章中，我们会利用这些思想来构建链表，其中的对象指向其他动态分配的对象。"

